  "summary": "Critic 4.1/10 on the running build. Strongest: heat and survival 7/10 \u2014 the causal chain fires end to end, cold -> a frozen sorter -> half rations -> an ultimatum -> exile -> an epilogue that names the dead. Legibility 6/10, and the overlay legends were called a real invention neither parent game has. Weakest: combat and the night 2/10, the automation pillar 3/10 (96% of all fuel in this city is carried on peoples backs), first impression 3/10, feel 3/10. The blind comparison: OURS 1 (information design), EVEN 1 (onboarding), THEIRS 8.",
